WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.562
This is the final completion step for Assignment 5
The slide deck

00:00:04.588 --> 00:00:09.112
tracks ten knowledge checks and six coding exercises
for sixteen required activities

00:00:09.138 --> 00:00:14.700
in total Before selecting Complete Module review the
counters If

00:00:14.725 --> 00:00:18.138
anything is missing the page will list incomplete
activities and let you

00:00:18.162 --> 00:00:22.175
jump back to the relevant slide When you complete
the module the

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:26.075
page creates a Canvas submission summary that
includes your knowledge-check status and

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:30.962
the SQL from each coding exercise Review the report
before copying it

00:00:31.838 --> 00:00:34.700
Your work is stored locally in the current browser
so it may

00:00:34.712 --> 00:00:38.912
not follow you to another device private window or
cleared browser storage
